flowchart TD
    app[Shell or agent] --> pty[PTY held by kanna3-keeper]
    pty --> read[kanna3d read_pty: up to 8192 bytes]
    read --> ring[Replay ring and per-client output queues]
    read --> parser[Byte-budgeted parser command queue]
    parser --> track[Kanna escape-sequence tracker]
    track --> vt[libghostty-vt terminal state]
    vt --> replies[PTY replies]
    replies --> pty
    vt --> detect[Screen formatting and agent detection]
    vt --> snap[Native snapshot and persistence]
    ring --> socket[Framed local socket stream]
    socket --> worker[Swift reader and attachment worker]
    worker --> main[One main-queue callback per output frame]
    main --> replica[Replica queue and offset-ordered grid changes]
    replica --> ffi[Copy into Ghostty external-output mailbox]
    ffi --> io[Ghostty IO thread: parse under terminal lock]
    snap -. attach or resync .-> replica
    io --> state[Viewport snapshot under terminal lock]
    state --> cpu[Renderer: styles, dirty rows, cached shaping]
    cpu --> gpu[Metal cell buffers and glyph textures]
    gpu --> pixels[IOSurface / Core Animation presentation]
